---
import { images } from '../lib/images';
---

<section id="features" class="bg-white py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 md:px-8">
    <div class="animate-on-scroll slide-up mb-14 text-center md:mb-16">
      <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-violet-600">Features</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-[#0c0a12] md:text-5xl">
        すべてを繋ぎ、<br class="hidden sm:block" />美しく自動化する。
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base text-slate-500">
        SNS運用・企画・売上管理をひとつに。BuzzItが現場の代わりに、自律的に回します。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-6">
      <!-- Large card -->
      <article class="animate-on-scroll slide-up group relative col-span-1 min-h-[420px] overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] md:col-span-2">
        <img
          src={images.teamWork}
          alt="チームでSNS運用"
          class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[1.2s] group-hover:scale-105"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0c0a12] via-[#0c0a12]/40 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="relative flex h-full flex-col justify-end p-8 md:p-10">
          <span class="mb-3 inline-flex w-fit rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-violet-200 backdrop-blur">Team</span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white md:text-3xl">全社を巻き込む仕組み</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70 md:text-base">
            Slack連携で社員のアイデアを吸い上げ、担当者の孤独をなくす。店舗の熱量をそのままSNSへ。
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Text cards -->
      <article class="animate-on-scroll slide-up delay-100 flex flex-col rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 bg-[#faf9fc] p-8 transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg">
        <div class="mb-6 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-violet-100 text-violet-600">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-[#0c0a12]">思考ゼロのUX</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          AIが提示する「今日やること」だけ実行。何を投稿するか悩む時間は、もう終わりです。
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="animate-on-scroll slide-up delay-100 flex flex-col rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-100 bg-[#faf9fc] p-8 transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg">
        <div class="mb-6 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-rose-100 text-rose-600">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-[#0c0a12]">一気通貫の自動化</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          1本の動画から各SNS向けに最適化。Auto Modeなら完全自動運用も可能です。
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Large image card -->
      <article class="animate-on-scroll slide-up delay-200 group relative col-span-1 min-h-[420px] overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] md:col-span-2">
        <img
          src={images.salonInterior}
          alt="サロン店内"
          class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[1.2s] group-hover:scale-105"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0c0a12] via-[#0c0a12]/40 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="relative flex h-full flex-col justify-end p-8 md:p-10">
          <span class="mb-3 inline-flex w-fit rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-200 backdrop-blur">Revenue</span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white md:text-3xl">深い売上トラッキング</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70 md:text-base">
            いいねではなく来店・売上にどう繋がったかを可視化。リアル店舗とデジタルの成果を直結させます。
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
